    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tae Kwon Dog</strong> is a simple <i>infinite runner</i> game where the goal is to achieve the highest possible score to compete on the leaderboard. The main mechanic involves performing as many combos as possible without touching the ground, while avoiding the dog getting hit in the face to prevent losing lives and ending the game.</p>",
